            </div>
            <div class="col-8 float-end">
                The TMCI has supported the Wounded Warrior Family Support for many years and we will continue to support this organization with 100% of all fundraiser proceeds. If you want to donate to the Wounded Warrior Family Support we can help just contact any of our club members or click <a href="https://wwfs.org/donate/" target="_blank">here</a>.
            </div>
            
